Only the initial Offer Document will count towards resolution, later amendments or supplementary offer documents will have no impact.&#x20;

Amendments to the offer price or minor adjustments to the takeover terms prior to publication will not prevent a Yes resolution, provided the core acquisition of Delivery Hero by Uber remains the same.

If the Business Combination Agreement is terminated, or the takeover offer is withdrawn or abandoned, before an Offer Document is published, this question will immediately resolve as No.
